	k j > ɡ ʒ / V_V
	# “These next two changes are awkward - Basically, when the final vowel drops off
	# 			down below, the newly-final d should become w; BUT d should also have become z and
	# 			disappeared before the final vowels drop off, leaving a dilem[m]a... I’m not certain how
	# 			this should be [interpreted]”
	d > z / V_V
	z > ∅ / V_V
	d > w / _V#
